      "detail": "The existing find/filter/strict midpoint fold is consumed directly, with x,y,xy,xyz,xz,yz,B order, rising equality priority and previous-row midpoint ties. Above-mu is the actual fixed fall-x row; below/equal-mu comparisons use the genuine gated cap and its ordered-domain six-tent identity. The cap is still min(Theta, actual envelope); no desired candidate or alternate selector is supplied."
