      "detail": "Selected e>0,b<e,c<e,e<=256 and one raw lattice step with positive residual give span>=1/(e*z1)>=1/Q; hence strict span and positive rounded chord denominator. Original raw geometry and first log-series summand give log.lo>=2^40, and the signed square has lower endpoint>=1. source_jensenAssertions discharges the original Jensen division assertions; no finite cell guard is executed. The equal-endpoint chord branch is unreachable under the exported strict-width Geometry, not silently discarded for arbitrary boxes."
